---
title: "createTempRegistration (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_normalize: normalizedCardId = cardId.replace(/:/, '').toLowerCase()
    q_normalize --> q_check_existing: SELECT card_id FROM attendance.users WHERE card_id = normalizedCardId
    q_check_existing --> q_already_registered: existingCard found
    q_already_registered --> [*]: return success=false, "card already registered"
    q_check_existing --> q_generate_token: existingCard not found
    q_generate_token --> q_set_expiry: token = randomUUID()
    q_set_expiry --> q_insert: expiresAt = now + 24 hours
    q_insert --> q_error_insert: INSERT INTO member.temp_registrations fails
    q_error_insert --> [*]: return success=false, "temp registration failed"
    q_insert --> q_success: INSERT succeeds
    q_success --> [*]: return success=true, token, registrationURL

    note right of q_generate_token
        INV-001: token is a cryptographically random UUID
        INV-002: expiry is set to 24 hours (spec says 30min but code uses 24h)
        INV-003: card_id must not exist in attendance.users before registration
    end note
